              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafa suni keesa fulla isani baatani ch'ufa AABBO Waaqi keesani biyya ch'ufa isani sodaachisa, akuma inni kakhate, nami tokoleeni dandae isani dura ineju.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.25",
