                  "text": "Yos 8.33-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hojja AABBO Waaqi lafa isani fud'attani iti qubachu geetanini isani gahe, gaara Gerizimu irati wo eebiftani ammalle gaara Ebali irati wo abaartani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaareeni lamaani sunini galaana Yordani, gama suni, kara lafa gosa Kanaani ka lafa Araba keesa tau, d'aatu dira Gilgali, fulla mukha gudda woyyu ka more, gama ila adu injirtu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isani amma yayu galaana Yordani taaku geetani, aka lafa AABBO Waaqi keesani isanii kennu fud'attani iti qubattani. Hojja fud'attani iti qubattani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "seera anini ara isanii kennu kana ch'ufa jabeesa guuta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
